	(text "02 PI-4 attenuator (five binary L-sections for Z0 = 49.9k, relay energised = section in; 0-18 dB used of 0-31) and the phase inverter: 12AX7 LTP, DN2540 CCS tail about 2 mA, equal 100k plates, feedback into the second grid (sim/pi_nfb). Plate DC goes out on W24; the coupling caps are on the power amp (interfaces.md 10)."
